{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：中国钢材与铁矿石周度更新</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">钢材表观消费出现分化，长材环比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>而板材继续回落。MS最新一期中国钢铁与铁矿石周度更新显示，截至7月26日当周，长材表观消费量环比增加<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.2%</span>，板材则下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.8%</span>。同期钢材产量同步调整，长材周产量环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.9%</span>，板材下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.0%</span>。247家样本钢厂产能利用率回落0.6个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">89.2%</span>，但电弧炉产能利用率逆势上升2.5个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58.2%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份周度数据覆盖7月20日至26日，样本来自Mysteel。报告由MS亚洲有限公司分析师Rachel L Zhang、Hannah Yang与Chris Jiang共同署名。数据呈现的图景并不复杂：钢材供给端在调整，需求端长材与板材走势分离，而铁矿石侧则出现发运量<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>与钢厂库存下降并存的局面。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV7htYXqOzXaeGIkD1jQRsLxB8gyWfkgWGnA25jMdM4ow86KmH6fZ3CoMsu2wo67zP2hJuBplq1JJzmZCRap1RHfW7n4ynK8QY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">长材周度消费量<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">276.8万</span>吨，同比仅下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.9%</span>，基本持平于去年同期水平。板材消费量<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">535.1万</span>吨，同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.6%</span>，降幅明显大于长材。两者环比走势同样背离：长材<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.2%</span>，板材回落<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.8%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">板材需求偏弱并非新现象，但同比降幅在扩大。报告没有给出具体下游拆分，从数据形态看，板材对应制造业需求，长材对应建筑需求。长材消费同比接近持平，说明建筑端需求并未出现市场此前担心的快速调整；板材同比降幅扩大，则指向制造业订单的边际走弱。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> 长材与板材的分化值得关注。长材同比仅微降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.9%</span>，说明建筑需求有支撑；板材同比降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.6%</span>，制造业端不确定性更明显。看后续数据时，重点观察板材消费能否止住环比下滑，这比单周相对值更有信号意义。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWKXYMk0BaRg0NtVAtwFogibcl7wTSMQPKJlgzDQ9nFbKou1kiauvGZ47h9cRzricaX2PJKOMoIlicZ9GJJImYmRgQGM7jKbFmnRBc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.钢厂库存业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">钢厂端钢材库存<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">444.8万</span>吨，环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.3%</span>，同比上升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.6%</span>。贸易商端库存<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1191.1万</span>吨，环比上升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.0%</span>，同比上升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.4%</span>。贸易商库存同比增幅显著高于钢厂，说明中间环节累积了较多库存。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">产量调整而贸易商库存上升，意味着钢厂在向贸易商转移库存不确定性。钢厂库存环比下降，部分原因是产量减少而非需求拉动。贸易商库存同比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.4%</span>的增幅，是这份周报里最突出的库存信号，中间环节的消化速度值得跟踪。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWRogWkjoqpozZFc9ibGqkZfJkiaP7qltUfqwzf2iaxkL6lzFt78N20k7R3qmMUMp2quTv3ibGLQp0pG8o0qQpMaUFd2VVpoHadrlE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3.铁矿石发运量业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">澳大利亚与巴西合计发运量环比增加<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">159万</span>吨，其中澳大利亚增加<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">54万</span>吨，巴西增加<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">106万</span>吨。港口库存<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15358万</span>吨，环比微降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.1%</span>。钢厂端铁矿石库存环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.3%</span>至每厂<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">218万</span>吨，产能利用率上升0.1个百分点至61.3%，日均产量环比增加0.2%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">发运量<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>而港口库存基本持平，说明到港资源在较快进入生产环节。钢厂铁矿石库存下降的同时产能利用率微升，显示钢厂在维持生产的同时没有增加原料库存，采购节奏偏谨慎。这一组合在铁矿石定价上通常意味着短期供需偏平衡，但钢厂补库意愿不强会限制价格上行空间。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>： 铁矿石发运增加但钢厂没有同步补库，库存还在降。这说明钢厂对原料采购保持克制，按需采购为主。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXFesLP7zabvGuYxc8bX4nsyba4jV8ricogYryBU8scYS8eyw1icPQskB3PQicLiauN2ML8chJZaln2ibWPmErPI36BmqibVocoIdLtc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 42-MS-Greater China Materials-China Steel and Iron Ore Weekly Update-260730</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
